    en: "How to present the project you build: a multi-tenant ERP/SaaS on Node.js + Odoo + PostgreSQL, French Factur-X/Chorus e-invoicing, label-driven CI/CD, <b>AI-powered wizards</b> (a LangGraph agent over ERP data, GPT-4o regex generation) and the <b>Playwright E2E suite</b>. Interviewers love digging into your real project.",
